# yt-dlp / FFmpeg rules

- Highest practical quality: best video + best audio merge via FFmpeg.
- Use aria2c as external downloader for fragments of the **current** job only.
- Resume / continue enabled.
- Write into `%USERPROFILE%\Downloads\FrameForge\downloads\`.
- **Never** start a second video download while one is active.
- Preserve metadata when possible; never discard audio intentionally.
